'''Mystery Girl Yuki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] grants [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]], a faster attack rate, and longer range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

